# The package does not use dh-golang: the dependencies are downloaded from the
# Go module proxy during the build and linked into the single binary, so there
# is no set of golang-*-dev build dependencies for dh_golang to record here.
missing-static-built-using-field-for-golang-package

# The dependencies are downloaded at build time rather than shipped in the
# source package, so their licences cannot be attached to a Files paragraph.
# They are still reproduced in full because the code they cover is linked into
# the binary package; see the Comment field at the top of debian/copyright.
unused-license-paragraph-in-dep5-copyright *
